{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Binchou-tan","This is a story about a little girl who lives in an old house in the mountains. Her name is Bincho-tan. Each episode depicts a day in the life of Bincho-tan as she prepares her breakfast in the morning, goes to the forest to gather vegetables, does her household chores and rests at night after a day's work. She is surrounded by a group of close friends who add color to her ordinary yet simple life."],"ja":["びんちょうタン",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-750","ids":{"shikimori":750,"mal":750,"anilist":750,"kodik":"serial-26161"},"kodikIds":["serial-26161"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-26161":"2020-05-26T15:07:50Z"},"title":"Бинтё-тан","originalTitle":"Binchou-tan","alt":"びんちょうタン びんちょうタン","description":"Бинтё-тан — маленькая девочка, живущая в горном домике. Девочка живет одна, у нее нет друзей и близких. Она — сирота. Спит малютка на рваной постели, носит единственное кимоно, собирает дары природы и постоянно трудится в городе. Но жизнь Бинтё-тан меняется, когда она находит друзей. Аниме рассказывает о нелегкой жизни маленькой, но сильной духом Бинтё-тан, ее друзьях и суровой действительности.","year":2006,"type":"TV","genres":["Сёнен","Повседневность","иясикэй"],"rating":7.23,"popularity":5077,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/750/6b20c9c4af1c857ac8f36f35b0621cce.jpeg","width":322,"height":450},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/b868a453d79b0858d72afccd53212f7519ca3ce5.jpg","width":1024,"height":576}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-674","dubId":"674","label":"Люб. Одноголосый","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-26161","translationId":"674","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/ser